[ti:Din Mein Sarpanch]
[ar:VESAHE · hkfaduio]
[al:Sanatan & Devotional]
[by:Radio Vaigyaaniq — draft timing, unverified]
[00:02.92]Pinki… Pinki… maut ka samaan,
[00:06.90]Din mein sarpanch… raat shaitaan…
[00:10.88]Khoon bhi mera… kanoon bhi mera,
[00:14.85]Chaudharahat pe mera hai raaj…
[00:18.83]Ghaghra laal… chaandni raat,
[00:22.80]Aankhon mein jalta andhera saath…
[00:26.78]Raat meri hai… shikar mera,
[00:30.76]Zindagi pe bhi adhikaar mera…
